# data.gob is a //go:embed build artifact, deterministic from docs/. It is
# generated by `go generate ./...` (the release workflow runs this before
# building, so released binaries embed a fresh blob) — never committed, so
# doc-touching branches don't binary-conflict on it. Fresh clones must run
# `go generate ./...` once before `go build`/`go test`.
/generated/data.gob
